  "commands": [
    {
      "name": "Admin",
      "hidden": false,
      "description": "upgrade                List the breaking changes between two versions that touch this project.\nself verify            Check a udb binary against its release's published sha256.\nself install           Download a release binary and install it only if its sha256 matches.\nprojection status      Check an entity's projections (vector, search, graph, cache) against its rows.\nprojection backfill    Repair an entity's projections: enqueue a task for every missing or divergent row.\nup                     Reconcile a project's udb.yaml: policies, service accounts, seed data.\ndata seed              Upsert seed rows from a file through the broker (idempotent).\nadmin force-sync       Force the startup lifecycle from the CLI and exit with a JSON report.\nadmin release-lock     Terminate the PG session(s) holding the startup advisory lock (clear a stale lock).\nadmin reset-db         Drop all UDB-managed schemas + ledger tables (DESTRUCTIVE; needs --yes).\nadmin dry-run          Generate the SQL plan and exit WITHOUT applying (safe on production).\nadmin verify-audit     Verify the tamper-evident admin audit-log hash chain.\nsync-migrations        Sync db_ops/migrations with the current proto AST."
    },
